WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.460
The bubble the Sun blows round itself.

00:03.100 --> 00:10.415
From three hundred times the Earth's distance, the shells are the edges of the bubble the Sun's wind blows in the gas between the stars.

00:11.009 --> 00:18.370
Voyager 1 left it in 2012 and Voyager 2 in 2018, and the four marks are where they crossed its two inner edges.

00:18.868 --> 00:20.473
Those four places are measured.

00:20.892 --> 00:24.499
The shapes between them are a model, and the outer shell is a guess.
